[00:13.12]Ronald and Jean were driving along a quiet country road in southern England. 
[00:18.84]They were on the way to Westbury. 
[00:21.74]It was nearly midnight.

[00:25.16]Jean Ron … look over there. There's something in the sky. What is it?
[00:32.00]Ron I don't know what it is. It's probably a plane.
[00:34.42]Jean I don't think so. It's too big. and too bright.
[00:41.68]Ron Oh, no.
[00:42.42]Jean What's the matter?
[00:43.52]Ron The engine's stopped.
[00:44.68]Jean Why has it stopped?
[00:46.14]Ron I don't know why it's stopped. We'll have to find a garage.
[00:48.84]Jean Is there one near here?
[00:50.24]Ron Yes, there's one in the next village … but I don't know if it's open. It's very late.

[00:59.34]Suddenly there was a loud noise, and a big, bright silver object flew low over their car. 
[01:08.92]It stopped in mid-air, turned round and flew back over their car. 
[01:14.58]Then it went straight up into the sky and disappeared.

